@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 55
hide circle
hide stereotypes

title MED-06 - CLASS DIAGRAM: ALLOCATION STRATEGY

class AllocationService {
  + allocateImmediate(...): void
  + runAllocation(...): AllocationRun
}

interface TicketAllocationStrategy {
  + allocate(session, candidates, confirmedCount): AllocationPlan
}

class FcfsAllocationStrategy {
  + allocate(...): AllocationPlan
}

class LotteryAllocationStrategy {
  + allocate(...): AllocationPlan
}

class AllocationPlan {
  + confirmedIds: UUID[]
  + waitlistedIds: UUID[]
  + orderedCandidateIds: UUID[]
}

AllocationService --> TicketAllocationStrategy : uses
TicketAllocationStrategy <|.. FcfsAllocationStrategy
TicketAllocationStrategy <|.. LotteryAllocationStrategy
TicketAllocationStrategy --> AllocationPlan : returns

FcfsAllocationStrategy -[hidden]right- LotteryAllocationStrategy

note bottom of TicketAllocationStrategy
Strategy chỉ tính kết quả phân bổ.
AllocationService chịu trách nhiệm transaction và persistence.
end note

@enduml
